<title>COSTA RICA: SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT VENEZUELA 5-2 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT VENEZUELA 5-2 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>HEREDIA, Costa Rica 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica beat</p>
<p>Venezuela 5-2 in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Costa Rica - Allan Oviedo (12 and 90), Mauricio Solas</p>
<p>(45), Gerald Drummond (50), Luis Aranez (57).</p>
<p>Venezuela - Gerson Diaz (29), Osvaldo Palencia (59)</p>
<p>Attendance - 5,000</p>
</text>
